[00:23.28]1. As we encourage one another
[00:29.74]To serve Jehovah faithfully,
[00:35.96]We find the bonds of love are strengthened;
[00:42.12]Fine works bring peace and unity.
[00:49.36]The love we find among God’s people
[00:55.04]Gives each the courage to endure.
[01:02.24]Our congregation is a refuge,
[01:08.78]A place where we can feel secure.
[01:19.92]2. A word when spoken at the right time
[01:26.74]Is, oh, how comforting to hear!
[01:32.76]We hear these words of consolation
[01:38.76]From friends so faithful and so dear.
[01:46.20]How good it is to work together
[01:51.50]With those whose hopes and goals we share!
[01:58.28]We seek to strengthen one another
[02:04.58]And help each one his burden bear.
[02:12.36]3. As we with eyes of faith are seeing
[02:12.40]The nearness of Jehovah’s day,
[03:01.40]We need our gathering together
[03:07.88]To keep us walking in the way.
[03:16.48]United with Jehovah’s people,
[03:20.76]We hope to serve eternally.
[03:27.98]So we encourage one another
[03:34.84]To hold to our integrity.
